stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: buildLesson job stages
    accDescr: Six running stages under one lease. Rejection is final; model, storage and adapter failures retry.
    [*] --> queued: admitted in one transaction
    queued --> running: GPU runner with lesson adapter and Gemini key claims it
    state running {
        [*] --> downloadingInput
        downloadingInput --> screeningVideo
        screeningVideo --> generatingBodies: moves found
        generatingBodies --> writingLesson: measurements ready
        writingLesson --> checkingLesson: lesson written
        checkingLesson --> publishingAssets: bundle passes the app contract
    }
    running --> succeeded: lesson published
    running --> failed: lesson_rejected
    running --> retrying: lesson_unavailable, model_unavailable, reconstruction_failed
    retrying --> running: cached model answers reused
    retrying --> failed: 3 attempts or 24 h
    queued --> cancelled: project deleted
    running --> cancelled: project deleted
    succeeded --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
